{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfMZ8UcngW3xdWTcWywjq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在标准大气压（1 atm，101.325 kPa，大约是海平面的气压）下，**水的沸点是 100°C**，也就是 212°F。\n\n沸点会随气压改变：\n\n- **高海拔地区气压低，沸点也低。** 例如拉萨海拔约 3650 米，水大约在 88°C 就会沸腾。所以在高原上用普通锅煮饭容易夹生，常要用高压锅。\n- **气压升高，沸点也会升高。** 高压锅内的水可以加热到约 120°C。\n\n另外，按现行温标精确测量，纯水在标准大气压下的沸点约为 99.97°C，日常可以直接当作 100°C。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":758,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":985},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b560555-a41e-4308-9452-3e27a5261e4c","uuid":"fc973979-5e87-4d0a-9b08-391daa124428","timestamp":"2026-09-24T03:28:42.446Z","request_id":"req_011CfMZ8UFDMxy9tXJsvw4iW"}
